    "From receipts and ticks ToHuus learns how often you buy things. When something is probably due, it suggests it – it never puts anything on the list by itself.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "From receipts and ticks ToHuus learns how often you buy things. When something is probably due, it suggests it – it never puts anything on the list by itself."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aus Bons und Häkchen merkt sich ToHuus, wie oft ihr etwas kauft. Ist etwas wahrscheinlich fällig, schlägt es das vor – von allein kommt nichts auf die Liste."
          }
        }
      }
    },
