            "value": "Was fehlt? z. B. 2 Milch, Brot"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you get to a shop you saved here, ToHuus asks: “You're at Lidl – open the list?”. For this, iOS has to let ToHuus notice the place even when the app is closed (“Always”). Your location is never sent anywhere – the shop places and the check stay on this iPhone.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you get to a shop you saved here, ToHuus asks: “You're at Lidl – open the list?”. For this, iOS has to let ToHuus notice the place even when the app is closed (“Always”). Your location is never sent anywhere – the shop places and the check stay on this iPhone."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kommst du bei einem Laden an, den du hier gespeichert hast, fragt ToHuus: „Du bist bei Lidl – Liste öffnen?“. Dafür muss iOS ToHuus den Ort auch bei geschlossener App bemerken lassen („Immer“). Dein Standort geht nirgendwohin – die Läden und der Abgleich bleiben auf diesem iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who belongs to it?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Who belongs to it?"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wer gehört dazu?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who sees what?": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Who sees what?"
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wer sieht was?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whoever notices something is missing puts it on the list – by typing, speaking or from a receipt. Every row shows where it came from.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Whoever notices something is missing puts it on the list – by typing, speaking or from a receipt. Every row shows where it came from."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wer merkt, dass etwas fehlt, setzt es auf die Liste – getippt, gesprochen oder vom Bon. Jede Zeile zeigt, woher sie kommt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With or without AI": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
